  Lombok Usage Rules

  Use Lombok For:

  - {Name}TableNames: @Value + @Builder
  - {Name}Registry: @Value (immutable factory)
  - {Name}TransactionContainer: @Value + @Builder(toBuilder = true)
  - Table Implementations: @Value + @AllArgsConstructor

  DO NOT Use Lombok For:

  - {Name}SaveTransaction: Regular class with private final fields, constructor initializes txLog = new StringBuilder()

  Lombok Annotation Patterns

  // Simple annotation
  .addAnnotation(ClassName.get("lombok", "Value"))

  // Annotation with parameters - USE AnnotationSpec
  .addAnnotation(AnnotationSpec.builder(ClassName.get("lombok", "Builder"))
    .addMember("toBuilder", "$L", true)
    .build())

  // Field-level annotation
  .addAnnotation(ClassName.bestGuess("lombok.Builder.Default"))

